{"unit_id":"tag:0427:proof","translation":"我们已经看到“拟紧的（quasi-compact）”是fpqc基底局部的（local on the base），见引理<REF_0001>。因此，只需对“局部拟有限的（locally quasi-finite）”证明此引理。我们将用引理<REF_0002>证明这一点。该引理的假设(1)和(2)由《空间的态射（Morphisms）》的引理<REF_0003>得到。设<MATH_0001>是一个满射的（surjective）平坦（flat）态射（morphism），其源和目标是<MATH_0002>上的仿射概形（affine schemes）。设<MATH_0003>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism），并假设基底变换（base change）<MATH_0004>是局部拟有限的（locally quasi-finite）。我们必须证明<MATH_0005>是局部拟有限的（locally quasi-finite）。设<MATH_0006>是一个概形（scheme），且<MATH_0007>是满射的（surjective）和平展的（<ACCENT_0001>tale）。再次由《空间的态射（Morphisms）》的引理<REF_0004>，只需证明<MATH_0008>是局部拟有限的（locally quasi-finite）。由于<MATH_0009>是局部拟有限的（locally quasi-finite），且<MATH_0010>是一个概形（scheme），它在<MATH_0011>上平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale），我们得到（再次由同一个引理）<MATH_0012>是局部拟有限的（locally quasi-finite）。由于<MATH_0013>是一个fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering），由《下降（Descent）》的引理<REF_0005>得到<MATH_0014>是局部拟有限的（locally quasi-finite），如所欲证。\n","allowed_english":["fpqc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧的"},{"source_term":"local on the base","target_term":"基底局部的"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限的"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限的"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限的"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限的"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":